<title>SOUTH AFRICA: King changes name to show holding status.</title>
<headline>King changes name to show holding status.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>King Food Holdings Ltd said on Friday that it is to change its name to King Consolidated Holdings Ltd with effect from July 9 to more accurately relect the firm's business as a holding company.</p>
<p>The abbreviated name of the firm will change to Kingco.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom 27 11 482 1003</p>
